modules/search/assets/snowball/

# Hugo Go template sources. Files under layouts/ contain Go template directives
# ({{ ... }}) interleaved with HTML; Prettier's HTML parser does not understand
# Go template syntax and either errors out or rewrites the template into invalid
# Hugo. Webmanifest templates likewise contain Go templates.
**/layouts/**
**/*.webmanifest

# Images-module fixture content: deliberately trap-shaped Markdown test data
# (below-the-image attribute blocks and hostile URLs whose line structure is
# semantically load-bearing; Prettier would join or rewrap them).
modules/images/test/fixture/content/

# Agent-readiness widgets-fixture content: the same class of trap-shaped
# Markdown test data (bare URLs inside shortcode arguments and a bracketed
# title probe whose line structure is semantically load-bearing).
modules/agent-readiness/test/fixture-widgets/content/

# Accordion fixture content: trap-shaped Markdown test data. One case authors a
# shortcode inside a list item at FOUR spaces of indentation, which is exactly
# the CommonMark code-block threshold the module's .InnerDeindent handling
# exists to survive; Prettier normalizes list continuation to two spaces, which
# would delete the test by making it pass for the wrong reason.
shortcodes/accordion/test/fixture/content/

# Shortcode-smoke fixture content: the same trap shape. Its indented-callout
# case authors a shortcode inside a list item at FOUR spaces, the CommonMark
# code-block threshold that callout's .InnerDeindent handling exists to
# survive; normalizing the indentation would make that assertion pass for the
# wrong reason. (Already excluded from markdownlint for the same content.)
shortcodes/test-smoke/fixture/content/

